:''Not to be confused with [[Cosmic Cyclone]] or [[Mesocosmocyclone]].''
'''Super Cosmic Cyclone''' (スーパースペースサイクロン ''Sūpā Supēsu Saikuron'', '''Super Space Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[Cosmic Cyclone]] introduced in [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]]. It was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

