==Trivia==
*The pulsing purple behind Super Cosmic Cyclone's eye implies that it is in the process of creating a star.
*In the [https://twitter.com/PONOS_EN/status/939555252562522112 announcement Tweet] for [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]], the English [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] Twitter account mistakenly referred to Super Cosmic Cyclone as "Super Space Cyclone", its Japanese name.
*Super Cosmic Cyclone has the highest money drop of all [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s.
**With all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], it also has the lowest attack power and DPS of all Cyclones.
*Super Cosmic Cyclone's description implies that [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] should be best used for it, despite most of its main counters not having the Long Distance ability.
**It may be simply referring to Super Cosmic Cyclone's above-average range for a Cyclone (275, only behind [[The Perfect Cyclone]]'s 250-650 Long Distance), which means shorter-ranged units will not be able to consistently impede its advance.
*[[Mesocosmocyclone]] is implied to be Super Cosmic Cyclone's secret lovechild, especially in [[BCJP]].

